        {
            "title": "API Contract: Football Match Manager",
            "level": 1,
            "raw_content": "This document defines the RESTful API endpoints for the Football Match Manager backend.",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Base URL",
            "level": 2,
            "raw_content": "`/api/v1`",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Authentication",
            "level": 2,
            "raw_content": "All endpoints (except auth endpoints) require a valid JWT token in the Authorization header:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n```",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Endpoints",
            "level": 2,
            "raw_content": "",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Authentication",
            "level": 3,
            "raw_content": "- `POST /auth/register` - Register a new user\n- `POST /auth/login` - Login and receive JWT token\n- `POST /auth/logout` - logout (client-side token removal)",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Matches",
            "level": 3,
            "raw_content": "- `GET /matches` - Get list of matches with optional filtering\n  - Query Parameters:\n    - `leagueId` (UUID): Filter by league\n    - `dateFrom` (ISO string): Matches on or after this date\n    - `dateTo` (ISO string): Matches on or before this date\n    - `status` (string): Filter by status (upcoming, live, finished)\n    - `search` (string): Search by team name (home or away)\n    - `page` (int): Page number for pagination (default: 1)\n    - `limit` (int): Items per page (default: 20)...\n- `GET /matches/:id` - Get a specific match by ID\n- `GET /matches/:id/followers` - Get users following a specific match (requires auth)",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "User Follows",
            "level": 3,
            "raw_content": "- `POST /follows` - Follow a match\n  - Body: `{ \"matchId\": \"uuid\" }`\n- `DELETE /follows/:matchId` - Unfollow a match\n- `GET /follows` - Get all matches followed by the current user (requires auth)",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Teams",
            "level": 3,
            "raw_content": "- `GET /teams` - Get list of teams (optional search)\n  - Query Parameters:\n    - `search` (string): Search by team name\n    - `limit` (int): Limit results (default: 50)",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Leagues",
            "level": 3,
            "raw_content": "- `GET /leagues` - Get list of leagues\n  - Query Parameters:\n    - `country` (string): Filter by country\n    - `active` (boolean): Filter by active leagues",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Data Models",
            "level": 2,
