            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Error Responses",
            "level": 2,
            "raw_content": "All endpoints return appropriate HTTP status codes:\n- 200: Success\n- 201: Created\n- 400: Bad Request (validation error)\n- 401: Unauthorized\n- 403: Forbidden\n- 404: Not Found\n- 429: Too Many Requests (rate limiting)\n- 500: Internal Server Error\n\nError response body:\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": \"string\",\n  \"message\": \"string\",\n  \"details\": \"object (optional)\"\n}\n```",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
        {
            "title": "Rate Limiting",
            "level": 2,
            "raw_content": "- Auth endpoints: 5 requests per minute per IP\n- All other endpoints: 60 requests per minute per user",
            "mapped_to_template_field": null
        },
